				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1a818ef7-1315-45d0-8ad4-ea1d63306657")
	)
	(text "I[output positive] = (VCC - x * VCC) / (R26 + R_series)\nI[output negative] = x * VCC / (R26 + R_series)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 242.062 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a8fd992c-4945-429f-87df-d152a0c2fb37")
	)
	(text "Up to first order, for R26 >> R25 and R_[MCP] ~= R25:\nV+[output positive] = VCC * x + VCC * R25 / R26\nV+[output negative] = VCC * x - VCC * R25 / R26\n\nV+[output positive] > V+[output_negative]\n\n(If FSK_FILT < V+, output is positive, once FSK_FILT crosses V+, \noutput jumps to negative,  and as expected the V+ jumps a bit downwards)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.042 89.916 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b05d49e4-bc01-46dd-ab9f-337d4cc93e50")
	)
	(text "Or CD74HC4046AM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cd9a0092-9e49-464b-b111-77da69c9bdca")
	)
	(text "For cd74hc4046a (dataset names):\nTested working values that give \nf(0.8V) = 160kHz\nf(4.0V) = 315kHz\n\nR2 = 47k\nC1 = 1nF\nR2/R1 = 5\nR1 = 220k\n(R1C1 = 220us)\n(R2C1 = 47us)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.878 98.044 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e4a2ddd3-46f1-479f-b2df-ced07fc43585")
	)
	(text "For 74HC_HCT4046A (dataset names):\n(Untested values)\nfl = 100kHz\nR1C1 = 4e-5 (40us)\nfoff = 90kHz\nR2 = 150kOhm\nC1 = 700pF\nR1 = 57kOhm\n\n(R2C1 = 105us)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.28 98.298 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ea5dafcc-a130-4bf3-a37e-2893cdfdc015")
	)
	(text "Thevenin equivalent \n\nR_series = x (1-x) * 10k + R25\nV = x * VCC"
